flowchart TB
    Control[Control Backend]
    MailCore[Mail Core]
    Scanners[Scanner Nodes]
    DeepAI[Deep AI]
    DMARC[DMARC / BIMI]
    Consumers[Async Consumers]

    PG[(PostgreSQL\nSource of Truth)]
    Audit[(Admin Audit Store\nAppend-only)]
    Outbox[(Transactional Outbox)]
    Redis[(Redis / Valkey\nCache / Counters / Greylisting)]
    SQS[(Amazon SQS\nDurable Async Events)]
    S3[(Amazon S3\nArtifacts / Quarantine / Audit Checkpoints)]
    Queue[(Postfix Durable Mail Queue)]
    KMS[AWS KMS]
    Bao[OpenBao]

    Control --> PG
    Control --> Audit
    Control --> Outbox
    Control --> Redis

    MailCore --> PG
    MailCore --> Outbox
    MailCore --> Redis
    MailCore --> Queue
    MailCore --> S3

    Scanners --> S3
    Scanners --> Redis

    DeepAI -->|scoped eligible artifacts| S3
    DMARC --> PG

    Outbox --> SQS --> Consumers

    Audit -. immutable checkpoints .-> S3

    KMS --> S3
    KMS --> PG
    KMS --> Audit

    Bao --> Control
    Bao --> MailCore
    Bao --> Scanners
    Bao --> DeepAI
